{
  "name": "GearUp 07 · RAG Knowledge Base Ingest (Qdrant)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 7️⃣ Knowledge base ingestion (RAG)\nRun once, and again whenever documents change.\n\n1. *List documents*: the markdown files of the company knowledge base (here: raw files from this repo's `knowledge-base/` folder; swap for Google Drive, Notion, Confluence or an S3 bucket)\n2. *Download*: fetch each file as text\n3. *Qdrant Vector Store*: split into ~800-char chunks (120 overlap), embed with OpenAI `text-embedding-3-small`, store with the `source` filename as metadata so the assistant can cite it\n\nBefore re-indexing, delete the old collection (or point at a new one) to avoid duplicate chunks.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5a0d6f51-3f0e-4e2a-9b0c-3c1b6d6a7f01",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "0a7b8c21-6e0b-4c9a-8d1d-2f3a4b5c6d02",
      "name": "Start ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Knowledge-base documents to index. Replace the base URL with your own repo / storage.\nconst base = 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EvgeniiLes/n8n-ai-automation-portfolio/main/knowledge-base/';\nconst files = [\n  'shipping-and-delivery.md',\n  'returns-and-warranty.md',\n  'wholesale-terms.md',\n  'internal-faq-for-staff.md',\n];\nreturn files.map(file => ({ json: { file, url: base + file } }));"
      },
      "id": "1b8c9d32-7f1c-4dab-9e2e-3a4b5c6d7e03",
      "name": "List documents",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "2c9dae43-8a2d-4ebc-8f3f-4b5c6d7e8f04",
      "name": "Download document",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "qdrantCollection": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "gearup_kb"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3dadbf54-9b3e-4fcd-904a-5c6d7e8f9a05",
      "name": "Qdrant Vector Store",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreQdrant",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        680,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "text-embedding-3-small",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4ebec065-9c4f-4a0e-a15b-6d7e8f9aab06",
      "name": "OpenAI Embeddings",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        640,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonMode": "expressionData",
        "jsonData": "={{ $json.data }}",
        "options": {
          "metadata": {
            "metadataValues": [
              {
                "name": "source",
                "value": "={{ $('List documents').item.json.file }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "5fcfd176-ad5b-4b1f-826c-7e8f9aabbc07",
      "name": "Document loader",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        860,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chunkSize": 800,
        "chunkOverlap": 120,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "60d0e287-be6c-4c20-937b-8f9aabbccd08",
      "name": "Text splitter",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textSplitterRecursiveCharacterTextSplitter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        420
      ]
    }
  ],
